//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Intro

title: Intro
---
Dawn: <wave>Littlelake</wave>. Finally, a new start.
Dawn: Grandma’s house should be somewhere around here. I was told it would be near the station.
===



//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Tourist Train Sign

title: trainSign
---
Welcome to <wave>Littlelake</wave>.
Home to the littlest lake!
*Someone has written with a marker below it...*
<i>It's a pond!</i>.
*Below that, there's more marker.*
<i>Once again, any <b>pond allegations</b> can be brought up with the council</i>.
<<play_emote player_emote heart>>
===



//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Truck Blocking Road

title: OhShitMyTruck
---
Dawn: I don't think you can park there...
*The car won't budge.*
Dawn: Maybe whoever owns it can move it when they get back...
Dawn: Oh there's a note here:
Will be back in a bit..
===



