// Gardenbed

title: miscgardenbed
---
Various vegetables are growing in the garden bed.
<<view_model ModelViewerUI carrot>>
===

title:miscStorageShelf
---
The shelves are stocked with many old cans.
<<view_model ModelViewerUI can>>
===

title: miscPathToLake
---
The gate is shut tight.
===

title: wateringTomato
---
This tomato plant is looking a bit dry...
Some water and it should be as good as ever!
    -> Water it
        <<play_cutscene PlayerCutsceneAnimator character_water>>
        <<set_story StoryManager wateredTomatoes>>
        Dawn: It looks as good as can be!
        Dawn: Some ripe tomatoes as well!
===

title:findFlour
---
<<declare $foundFlourItem = false>>

An old cupboard with many decrepid things...
Surely the [o]flour[/o] isn't hiding here... right?
Where to look?
    -> Top Shelf!
        <<set_story StoryManager foundFlour>>
        <<set $foundFlourItem = true>>
        You barely reach the [o]glimmering[/o] item behind on the top shelf.
        Dawn: There it is!
    -> Bottom Shelf!
        Nothing here except old jars and cans
        Dawn: It's not here...
    -> In the drawer!
        Dawn: It's completely empty here!

<<if $foundFlourItem == false>>
Dawn: Hmm... it wasn't there, let me have another look.
<<jump findFlour>>
<<endif>>
===